{
 "name": "tiger_ye_yaohuo",
 "_variant": "V-C 妖火虎（look-dev 三方案之一）。基底＝assets/creatures/tiger.json，不動原檔。",
 "_paw_note": "buildPaw 的預設 offset 會把腳掌吸到地面（sole on ground）；抬起來的右前掌必須自己給 offset，否則掌會掉到 y=0.045 跟小腿脫節（part_attachment BLOCK 0.163）。",
 "_brief": "Yaohuo Tiger Lord: a temple 虎爺 possessed by ghost-fire. Charcoal-black fur with high-saturation ember bands burning along the flanks, eyes and the inside of the maw glowing, flame tongues on the tail tip and a jagged fire ridge down the spine. Deep crouch, head low, jaw wrenched wide. Feel: ferocious AND divine — a thing you kowtow to, not a thing you hug. Signature = the wide-open glowing maw. Identity view = side.",
 "_exaggeration_vs_anchor": "wolf anchor W/H 1.41 -> ~1.9 (crouched, long and very low); leg_fraction 0.35 -> ~0.24 (folded stump legs); the fire ridge + tail flames push the silhouette's turn_count up so it never reads as a smooth toy.",
 "_glow_materials": "eye / mouth_glow / glow_tail / glow_mane —— 命名是給 three.js 端用的：L 卷會把這些材質名接成 emissive，bloom 才吃得到。這份 spec 本身只把它們塗成高亮高飽和色。",

